{
    "title": "World War: Machines Conquest",
    "description": "Join 10 million players worldwide!\r\nCommand and conquer in this epic WW2 strategy game.\r\n\r\n\u25b6Conquer the Battlefield with Tactical Mastery!\r\nGather resources to reinforce your Base and build a powerful force with Aircraft and Tanks.\r\nTeam up with players from around the world and strategize using dynamic tactics to dominate your enemies.\r\nIt\u2019s time to test your mettle, Commander! \r\n\r\n\u25b6Real-Time Battles and Thrilling Challenges!\r\nPrepare the ultimate strategy and engage in epic, real-time battles to claim victory.\r\nDefeat contenders on the world stage to rise to the top of the PVP rankings!\r\n\r\n\u25b6Form Alliances and Save the World!\r\nForm powerful alliances and fight alongside players across the globe to claim victory in this epic war.\r\nExchange strategies with each other to build a formidable force to crush your enemies.\r\nThe fate of every battle lies in your hands! \r\n\r\nPlay now and command a relentless army of war machines and lead them into massive battles. Dominate the battlefield and forge your path to supremacy! \r\n\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Permissions Required by the Game\r\n[Required] Photo, Media, File Access\r\n- (For game updates) This right is required for the game to save update files on your device.\r\n- (Access to storage) This right is required to access photos, media and file information on the device for saving game settings and cache, and 1:1 inquiry support.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 How to Withdraw Access Rights\r\n[Android 6.0 or higher]\r\n- Device Settings > Apps > Choose App > Permissions > Withdraw Access Rights\r\n[Android versions older than 6.0]\r\n- These OS versions do not allow for withdrawing Apps\u2019 access rights, so it is required to delete the App in order to withdraw its access rights.\r\n\r\n*Words in the description may differ depending on the devices and OS versions used.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join 10 million players worldwide!<br>Command and conquer in this epic WW2 strategy game.<br><br>\u25b6Conquer the Battlefield with Tactical Mastery!<br>Gather resources to reinforce your Base and build a powerful force with Aircraft and Tanks.<br>Team up with players from around the world and strategize using dynamic tactics to dominate your enemies.<br>It\u2019s time to test your mettle, Commander! <br><br>\u25b6Real-Time Battles and Thrilling Challenges!<br>Prepare the ultimate strategy and engage in epic, real-time battles to claim victory.<br>Defeat contenders on the world stage to rise to the top of the PVP rankings!<br><br>\u25b6Form Alliances and Save the World!<br>Form powerful alliances and fight alongside players across the globe to claim victory in this epic war.<br>Exchange strategies with each other to build a formidable force to crush your enemies.<br>The fate of every battle lies in your hands! <br><br>Play now and command a relentless army of war machines and lead them into massive battles. Dominate the battlefield and forge your path to supremacy! <br><br><br>\u25c6 Permissions Required by the Game<br>[Required] Photo, Media, File Access<br>- (For game updates) This right is required for the game to save update files on your device.<br>- (Access to storage) This right is required to access photos, media and file information on the device for saving game settings and cache, and 1:1 inquiry support.<br><br>\u25c6 How to Withdraw Access Rights<br>[Android 6.0 or higher]<br>- Device Settings &gt; Apps &gt; Choose App &gt; Permissions &gt; Withdraw Access Rights<br>[Android versions older than 6.0]<br>- These OS versions do not allow for withdrawing Apps\u2019 access rights, so it is required to delete the App in order to withdraw its access rights.<br><br>*Words in the description may differ depending on the devices and OS versions used.",
